Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:24.78,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 穷途末路 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ It's a hopeless ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:28.91,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 万念俱灰 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Situation ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:33.12,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我开始相信 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ And I'm startin' to believe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.80,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 穷途末路 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ That this hopeless ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:43.18,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 万念俱灰 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Situation ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:46.85,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 这便是我的目标 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Is what I'm tryin' to achieve ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.16,0:45:15.20,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}Etta James翻唱《I Got You Babe》，发表于1968年\N原唱Sonny & Cher，发表于1965年
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.76,0:45:27.18,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 人们说我们不懂 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ People say that we don't know ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:29.64,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 不懂爱是什么 不懂爱的生长 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ What love is or how to make it grow ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:39.11,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 因为宝贝 我们拥有彼此  ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ 'Cause you got me, and, baby, I got you ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.11,0:45:41.11,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 哦 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Oh, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.11,0:45:45.95,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 宝贝 有我在 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you, babe, I got you, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.95,0:45:48.91,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 人们说我们的爱付不起房租 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ They say our love won't pay the rent ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.91,0:45:53.66,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 钱还没挣到 就都花了出去 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Before it's earned, our money's all been spent ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.66,0:45:56.00,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 这话不假 我们有的不多 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Guess that's true, we don't have a lot ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:59.46,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 但我对所有之物都有把握 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ But at least I'm sure of all the things we've got ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.46,0:46:02.17,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 哦 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Oh, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.17,0:46:08.09,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.09,0:46:12.06,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我有春天的花儿 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got flowers in the spring, yeah ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.06,0:46:17.10,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 戴上我的戒指 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I've got you, I've got you to wear my ring ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.10,0:46:21.82,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 当我悲伤 你愿扮作小丑 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ And when I'm sad, you're a clown ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.82,0:46:26.74,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 当我害怕 你在我身边 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ And when I get scared, you're always around ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.74,0:46:27.91,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 哦噢 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Ooh ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.64,0:46:52.76,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 哦 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ Oh, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.76,0:46:56.02,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 宝贝 有我在 宝贝 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you, babe, I got you, babe ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:01.52,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 你握住了我的手 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you to hold my hand ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.52,0:47:03.90,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 你明白了我的意 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you to understand ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.90,0:47:06.24,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 你我走在了一起 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you to walk with me ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.24,0:47:08.90,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 你我谈天又谈地 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ And I got you to talk with me ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.20,0:47:12.74,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 抱紧我 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you, hold me tight ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:14.79,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 有我在 不会放手 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you, I won't let go ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.79,0:47:18.79,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,♪ 我让你爱上了我 ♪\N{\fs50}{\i1}♪ I got you to love me so ♪{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:06.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 操 操 操\N{\fs50}Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老天 你得帮帮我 别吓我\N{\fs50}Come on, you gotta help me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.88,0:02:13.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fs50}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:15.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 闭嘴 乔尔\N{\fs50}- Leave. - Shut up, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 带上枪 - 乔尔 你他妈闭嘴！\N{\fs50}- Take the gun. - Joel, shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:22.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 你走 往北走\N{\fs50}You go. You go. You go north.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:24.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去找汤米\N{\fs50}You go to Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:27.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你快走\N{\fs50}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:49.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还给我！\N{\fs50}Give 'em back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你得跑快点\N{\fs50}Then pick up your pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:54.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想因为你狗屎一样的态度再被罚跑\N{\fs50}I'm not running doubles again because of your shitty attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:56.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想和你起冲突\N{\fs50}I don't wanna fight about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:57.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你和我？\N{\fs50}Fight about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,起冲突的不是你\N{\fs50}You don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是你朋友\N{\fs50}Your friend fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:03.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她已经不在这儿了吧 对不对？\N{\fs50}She's not here anymore, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:43.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fs50}What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你虽说算不上乖孩子\N{\fs50}You've never been what I'd call well-behaved,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:47.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但过去几周太过分了吧？\N{\fs50}but the last few weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,贝瑟尼先挑事的\N{\fs50}Bethany started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可是 贝瑟尼去医务室缝了15针\N{\fs50}Well, Bethany's in the infirmary with 15 stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:04:59.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好极了 - 行了\N{\fs50}- Good. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈直接关我禁闭就行了\N{\fs50}Just put me in the fuckin' hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:04.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我关了你三次 这招不管用\N{\fs50}I put you in the hole three times. It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在换个方式\N{\fs50}So I'm gonna try something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:07.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我来和你讲讲道理\N{\fs50}I'm gonna tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你很聪明 艾莉 明明天分很好 却干这种蠢事\N{\fs50}You're smart, Ellie. You're so smart, you're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:15.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看不明白当前的情况吗？\N{\fs50}You can't see where this is going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我帮你捋捋\N{\fs50}Let me help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你面前有两条路\N{\fs50}Two paths ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:22.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一条路\N{\fs50}First path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,继续按普通士兵的标准来 然后过上普通士兵的生活\N{\fs50}You keep acting like a grunt, so you get the life of a grunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:27.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天亮就起床 上街巡逻 沿着隔离墙巡逻\N{\fs50}Up at dawn. Walk the streets, walk the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,吃最屎的饭 干最屎的活\N{\fs50}Ya eat shit food, ya do shit jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:31.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从巡逻队长那里接的也都是屎任务\N{\fs50}ya take shit orders from your patrol leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而这个队长很可能就是贝瑟尼\N{\fs50}who'll probably be Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:38.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,从现在开始 你这辈子就这样了 直到某天吃了火萤的枪子儿\N{\fs50}And that'll be your life from now until ya catch a bullet from a Firefly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:39.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或者喝醉了从屋顶摔下来\N{\fs50}or fall drunk off a roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要不就是头发被前行的坦克履带给绞了\N{\fs50}or get your hair caught in a moving tank tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:44.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有另一条路\N{\fs50}There's the other path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:46.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放下自尊 忍气吞声\N{\fs50}You swallow this pride of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,遵守规则 当上军官\N{\fs50}You follow the rules. You become an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会有自己的房间 舒服的床\N{\fs50}You get your own room. You get a nice bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你瞧 我们吃得好 还不用巡逻\N{\fs50}We eat well. We don't go on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,夏天凉快 冬天暖和\N{\fs50}We're cool in the summer. We're warm in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最重要的是 你当上军官\N{\fs50}And best of all, when you're an officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:02.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你交待贝瑟尼们要干吗 他们就得照做\N{\fs50}you get to tell the Bethanys of the world exactly where to shove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么要在乎我？\N{\fs50}Why do you even care?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:14.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不管其他人怎么说怎么想 我在乎是因为\N{\fs50}I care because no matter what anyone out there says or thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你我这样的人才能让生活正常运作下去\N{\fs50}we're the only thing holding this all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:20.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没了我们 隔离区的人要么会饿死 要么会自相残杀\N{\fs50}If we go down, the people in the zone will starve or murder each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这结局我很明白\N{\fs50}That much I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你有领导天赋\N{\fs50}There's a leader in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,终有一天 责任会落到你头上\N{\fs50}And one day, it could be your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也可能不会\N{\fs50}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:36.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 你选哪条路？\N{\fs50}So, which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:43.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第二条\N{\fs50}Keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:44.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:50.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就行了？\N{\fs50}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就行了\N{\fs50}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:58.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随身听可以还给我吗？\N{\fs50}Can I have my Walkman back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:57.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,姑娘们 熄灯！\N{\fs50}Lights out, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:01.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,关灯！\N{\fs50}Turn 'em off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:05.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉！你去哪儿了？\N{\fs50}Riley! Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈搞什么鬼？偷偷摸摸地接近我\N{\fs50}What the fuck is wrong with you, sneaking up on me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我闹着玩的 行了吧？\N{\fs50}It was a joke, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:10.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以为这么做会挺好玩的\N{\fs50}I thought it would work better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我印象中 你喜欢这样\N{\fs50}In my mind, you loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:17.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fs50}So
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你最近还好吗？\N{\fs50}how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:23.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道了 你过得不好\N{\fs50}Okay, it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fs50}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:25.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你失踪了三周\N{\fs50}You've been gone for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:27.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈就该捅了你\N{\fs50}I should fuckin' stab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别别 我感激你的慈悲之心\N{\fs50}No, I appreciate your mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:35.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fs50}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:36.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我挺好的\N{\fs50}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:38.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我出走了一小会儿 就是这样\N{\fs50}I just ran away for a bit, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:40.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你遇到了什么破事 我想 你应该\N{\fs50}If you're going through some shit, you're supposed to, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和你最好的朋友说说？\N{\fs50}talk to your best friend about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fs50}I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:49.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 谁把你的眼睛打青了？\N{\fs50}Wait, who gave you the black eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟我说说你去了哪儿\N{\fs50}Tell me where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告诉我是谁干的 我去揍死他\N{\fs50}Gimme a name and I'll fuck 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:54.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是贝瑟尼 但我已经揍了她了\N{\fs50}It was Bethany and I already fucked her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:55.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你究竟去哪儿了？\N{\fs50}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我加入了火萤\N{\fs50}I joined the Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:15.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉 我没心情和你开玩笑 真没心情\N{\fs50}I'm not in the mood for this, Riley. I'm really not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:19.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你真的成火萤了？ - 老天啊！\N{\fs50}- You're a Firefly? - Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈早就跟你说过了\N{\fs50}I told you I'd fuckin' do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:23.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘴上说说“解放隔离区”是一回事 这是另一回事\N{\fs50}Talking about "liberating the QZ" is not the same as--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 操你的 你到底去—— - 放松 放松\N{\fs50}- Fuck. Where did you even-- - Slow down, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我全都会告诉你\N{\fs50}I will tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:29.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但首先 你要答应我的要求\N{\fs50}But first, you have to promise me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:33.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有点疯狂 你肯定会先拒绝我 但你最后得答应我\N{\fs50}Sort of crazy, and you're gonna say no, but then you have to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:39.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,跟我出去几个钟头 度过你生命中最美妙的一晚\N{\fs50}Come with me for a few hours, and have the best night of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:42.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行了 现在你可以说好了\N{\fs50}Okay, now say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:45.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会跟你去其他地方\N{\fs50}I'm not going anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在——\N{\fs50}It's--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:47.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真棒 现在已经凌晨2点了\N{\fs50}Great. It's 2:00 AM.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:51.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再过几个小时 我有训练课要上 学习怎么杀死火萤\N{\fs50}And in a few hours, I have drills where we learn to kill Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,换衣服\N{\fs50}Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:58.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,太蠢了\N{\fs50}So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:02.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转过身去\N{\fs50}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真搞不懂你\N{\fs50}You're so weird about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你是打算去公园玩\N{\fs50}If you're thinking about hanging in the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那地方再也进不去了\N{\fs50}we can't go there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:28.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们最近安排了巡逻队\N{\fs50}There's a new patrol that they just put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:30.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反正我们也不去公园\N{\fs50}Well, we're not going to the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:33.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我们要去哪儿？\N{\fs50}So where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,先保密\N{\fs50}Secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fs50}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你相信我 对吧？\N{\fs50}You trust me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不确定 应该吗？\N{\fs50}I don't know. Should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:42.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你当然要相信我 命都可以交给我\N{\fs50}Of course, you should. With your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:53.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 巡逻队？ - 没人 FEDRA蠢透了\N{\fs50}- Guards? - No, 'cause FEDRA's fucking stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？ - 最好有意思\N{\fs50}- Ready? - This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,FEDRA好歹没他妈那么蠢 对吧？\N{\fs50}Not that fuckin' stupid, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,勉勉强强 开局不算顺利\N{\fs50}Okay, rocky start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.35,0:12:17.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但还不是最糟糕的\N{\fs50}Could've been worse, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:19.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还记得7-11那次么\N{\fs50}Could've been a 7-11 situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:20.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得亏不是\N{\fs50}No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:22.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可不想让另一条眉毛也断了\N{\fs50}I'd like to keep my other eyebrow in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那既然你对自我保护突然起了兴趣\N{\fs50}Well, since you're so interested in self-preservation all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许你还是别招惹贝瑟尼为好\N{\fs50}maybe you should stop fucking with Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:29.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么动的手？\N{\fs50}What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别管了 原因很蠢\N{\fs50}Nothing. It's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:33.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她缝了15针\N{\fs50}She had to get 15 stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:35.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许你不该招惹像她那样的人\N{\fs50}Maybe you shouldn't mess with people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:39.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你的意思是让我别揍人？\N{\fs50}I'm sorry. Are you telling me not to beat people up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可是让卡罗尔在医务室里躺了他妈一周哎\N{\fs50}You put Carol in the infirmary for a fuckin' week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:44.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你没法跟每个人都干一架\N{\fs50}I'm just saying, you can't fight everything and everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:46.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你得选重点对手\N{\fs50}You can pick and choose what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:49.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 你在火萤大学学的？\N{\fs50}Oh, are they teaching you this at Firefly University?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:51.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,差不多吧 对\N{\fs50}Kinda, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:54.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有 操他妈的卡罗尔\N{\fs50}And fuck Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操他妈的卡罗尔 干死她\N{\fs50}Fuck Carol. Fucking Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:01.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我们往哪儿走？ - 先穿过这扇破窗\N{\fs50}- Where are we going? - Through a damn window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:17.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fs50}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:22.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看看这些水顺着锈迹斑斑的信箱滴下来\N{\fs50}Look at how that water trickles down those rusty mailboxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:24.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这真是我生命中最好的一夜\N{\fs50}This really is the best night of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 看到没？ - 看到了\N{\fs50}- See? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,火萤的手电筒质量更好\N{\fs50}Firefly lights are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 无政府主义者得一分\N{\fs50}Congrats. One point for the anarchists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们更喜欢自由斗士这个称呼\N{\fs50}We prefer freedom fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:36.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\fs50}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:38.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要爬多少层楼？\N{\fs50}How many floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该两层吧\N{\fs50}Like two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他妈的搞什么？\N{\fs50}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我很抱歉\N{\fs50}Okay, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:51.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你的两层楼\N{\fs50}Two floors. Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有点心不在焉\N{\fs50}I was a tad bit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fs50}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 他死了吗？ - 死透了\N{\fs50}- Is he dead? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是特大惊喜吗？\N{\fs50}Is this the big surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:03.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然不是 这家伙昨天还不在这里\N{\fs50}No, this guy wasn't here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:22.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fs50}So disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:32.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这真的是酒吗？\N{\fs50}Is that real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:33.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瓶子挺真的\N{\fs50}Bottle's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就连酒也不是私酿的 像是 以前的\N{\fs50}This isn't moonshine either. It's, like, from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这家伙一定是用上所有配给卡 才搞来这玩意儿\N{\fs50}This guy must've spent every card he had to get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:45.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人和他说过 药和这东西不能混着来？\N{\fs50}No one told him he couldn't mix pills with that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:47.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想他知道自己在干嘛\N{\fs50}I think he knew what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:58.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你太坏了 自己心里有数 对吧？\N{\fs50}You're sick. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你刚刚也笑了 现在还在笑\N{\fs50}You laughed, too. You're laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:02.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了 我们到底要不要喝？\N{\fs50}Okay, we drinkin' it or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:03.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好喝 - 给我\N{\fs50}- Yum. - Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:15.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啊 好\N{\fs50}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,味道爽歪歪\N{\fs50}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:33.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,刚刚是你第一次看到尸体吗？\N{\fs50}Was that the first dead body you ever saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一次是我爸妈的\N{\fs50}My parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:41.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 抱歉 我知—— 我之前知道这事儿\N{\fs50}Yeah. Sorry. I know-- I mean, I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:44.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 没事 给我\N{\fs50}No, it's fine. It's fine. Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能试试你的枪吗？\N{\fs50}Can I hold your gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们让我发誓\N{\fs50}They kinda made me swear
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.78,0:15:57.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不让其他人碰我的枪\N{\fs50}not to let other people handle my sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:01.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“动我的枪试试 我他妈是个火萤”\N{\fs50}"Not to handle my sidearm 'cause I'm such a fuckin' Firefly."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:04.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fs50}Give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:06.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 行\N{\fs50}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:13.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很重\N{\fs50}It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:15.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可以了吧\N{\fs50}'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:27.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,究竟咋回事？难道你和火萤的某个家伙约上了会\N{\fs50}So, what happened? You started dating some Firefly dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:30.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后就觉得 “哇 太酷了 我也想当恐怖分子”\N{\fs50}and was like, "Oh, this is cool. I think I'll be a terrorist."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:32.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对啊 就这么回事 而且我们快结婚了\N{\fs50}Yup. That's it. We're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:36.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说真的 为什么？\N{\fs50}But really. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:44.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听好 有一个晚上 你被关了禁闭\N{\fs50}Okay, one night, you were in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:46.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我太无聊了 偷溜出来\N{\fs50}I got bored, so I snuck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:49.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在回去的路上 我小心翼翼\N{\fs50}I was on my way back, being stealthy like I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,突然有个妞蹦了出来\N{\fs50}And this chick popped outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妞 和我们一样大？\N{\fs50}Chick, like our age?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:54.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 大概40岁吧\N{\fs50}No. Like, 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:55.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或者50\N{\fs50}Or 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无所谓了 反正就 挺老\N{\fs50}Whatever. Anyways, old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:17:02.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她跟我说 看着我偷偷摸摸 躲开巡逻队\N{\fs50}She said she was impressed watching me sneak around,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:04.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让她印象深刻\N{\fs50}avoiding guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:07.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她接着问我 怎么看FEDRA\N{\fs50}and she asked what I thought about FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:08.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我跟她说了实话\N{\fs50}So I told her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这帮法西斯恶棍 他们就应该\N{\fs50}They're fascist dickbags, and they're the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为自己犯的罪行受到惩罚 该吊死的是他们 不是平民\N{\fs50}that should be getting hanged for their crimes, not the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:17.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后她说 “那好 如果你想加入我们 就来吧”\N{\fs50}She's like, "All right. If you want in, you're in."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:20.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就这样？没有诡异的入伙仪式？\N{\fs50}That's it? No weird initiations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 我说好 于是我现在就是火萤了\N{\fs50}Nope. I said yes, and now I'm a Firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:25.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么容易就放弃你所有的一切了？\N{\fs50}That easy to give up everything, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:29.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说的“一切”是指成为那帮法西斯恶棍中一员？\N{\fs50}By "everything," you mean becoming a fascist dickbag?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 我不确定是不是真那么简单\N{\fs50}I mean, I don't know if it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:35.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,某种程度上 FEDRA撑住了这个局面\N{\fs50}Like, in a way, FEDRA kinda holds everything together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:39.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看 虽然我确实想跟你这个顽固的小杠精拌嘴\N{\fs50}Ya know, as much as I love arguing with your stubborn ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们出来是有目的的\N{\fs50}we're on a mission here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:20.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 停下 停\N{\fs50}Okay, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 让我喘口气 - 好\N{\fs50}- Gimme a second. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些灯之前没亮起来\N{\fs50}Those lights are new.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:32.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 几周前他们给这个街区通了电\N{\fs50}Yeah, they wired up the block a couple weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:35.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你懂的 隔离区人口增加 自然需要更多住的地方\N{\fs50}You know, more people in the QZ, so more apartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:37.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看来FEDRA确实没那么邪恶\N{\fs50}So FEDRA's not entirely bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:40.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,法西斯恶棍们让人民挨饿\N{\fs50}Fascist dickbags starving their own population.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,火萤炸了仓库也算不上做好事吧\N{\fs50}Fireflies blowing up the storage depot didn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:45.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都是洗脑的屁话\N{\fs50}Propaganda bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的吗？你们不再炸东西了？\N{\fs50}Yeah? So you don't bomb stuff anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:49.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不炸平民区\N{\fs50}Not when civilians are around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:50.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那也是洗脑的屁话\N{\fs50}That's propaganda bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咋啦？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:56.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第一\N{\fs50}One,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.26,0:18:57.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就算你了解到的很片面 也没关系\N{\fs50}it's okay you don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:18:59.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求同存异吧\N{\fs50}Agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第二 我们到了\N{\fs50}And two, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是说那个商场？你他妈疯了？\N{\fs50}The mall? You out of your fuckin' mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:16.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们把商场封掉是有理由的 里面都是感染者\N{\fs50}They sealed that place off for a reason. It's full of Infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.19,0:19:18.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果真的封了 那么\N{\fs50}If it's sealed off, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么没有全封完？\N{\fs50}why isn't it sealed off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:49.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,又粘又滑\N{\fs50}It's slimy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:52.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 这个区域对外暴露有几年了\N{\fs50}Yeah. It's been exposed for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:55.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当FEDRA把这一带通上电\N{\fs50}So, turns out when FEDRA connected that block up to the grid,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:58.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里也来电了\N{\fs50}this place got connected, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可他们不知道这点\N{\fs50}Not that they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:02.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们来这里干吗？\N{\fs50}So what are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是要被电死还是——\N{\fs50}Trying to get electrocuted, or--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:07.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fs50}Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你先穿过那扇门 一直走 往右拐\N{\fs50}You're gonna go through there, then turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:12.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你会看见另一扇门 穿过去 等着我\N{\fs50}You'll see a door. Go through it. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:13.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不要\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈右拐 开门\N{\fs50}Fucking turn right, open the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:17.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后告诉我你到了\N{\fs50}tell me when you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:18.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在就走\N{\fs50}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:19.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:21.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要害死我吗？\N{\fs50}Are you gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.42,0:20:23.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里看上去简直是天选之地\N{\fs50}This seems like a perfect place to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fs50}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:44.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你到了吗？\N{\fs50}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我到了！现在干吗？\N{\fs50}I'm here! Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:50.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你这垃圾玩意儿 给点力啊\N{\fs50}You fucking piece of shit. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:13.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fs50}So
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:16.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\N{\fs50}what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:18.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这\N{\fs50}It's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈—— 等下 灯光\N{\fs50}it's fuckin'-- Wait. The lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事的 你刚在外面也看到了\N{\fs50}We're fine. You saw outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:26.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里就像个大地堡\N{\fs50}It's like a big bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:28.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人看得到这些 除了咱俩\N{\fs50}No one can see shit but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:29.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只有你和我\N{\fs50}Just me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:33.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且好东西还没登场呢\N{\fs50}And you ain't seen nothin' yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:38.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今晚 我要向你展示商场的四大奇迹\N{\fs50}Tonight, I'm gonna show you the four wonders of the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你都策划好了？\N{\fs50}You planned stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:48.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是吧！\N{\fs50}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:53.70,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,a-ha《Take on Me》，发表于1985年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:51.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,通电的楼梯？\N{\fs50}Electric stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:53.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这叫电动扶梯\N{\fs50}Escalator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:54.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,电动扶梯？\N{\fs50}Escalator?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上去试试吧\N{\fs50}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.77,0:22:03.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,绝了！\N{\fs50}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:08.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快看我 老天啊！这也太酷了！\N{\fs50}Check me out, man! This is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:10.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看！倒退\N{\fs50}Look! Backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:15.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,前进！再倒退！\N{\fs50}Forwards! And backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:17.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我现在相对静止\N{\fs50}And now I'm not goin' anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:18.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没在动！\N{\fs50}I'm not moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是第一个奇迹 对吗？\N{\fs50}So this is the first wonder, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:22.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 当然\N{\fs50}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:25.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,商场里可以有五大奇迹\N{\fs50}There can be five wonders in this mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,小心点！\N{\fs50}Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.35,0:22:33.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我来了 - 你在做什么？\N{\fs50}- I'm coming for you. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.68,0:22:35.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,喔喔 该死\N{\fs50}Ooh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:37.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 老天啊 艾莉 - 没事 我很好\N{\fs50}- Jesus, Ellie. - No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:39.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你真的没事吧？\N{\fs50}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:40.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 对 我没事 就是绊了一下\N{\fs50}Yeah, yeah, I'm fine. I just tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:42.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:43.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fs50}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.69,0:22:49.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你真是个优雅的芭蕾舞者\N{\fs50}You are just a graceful ballerina.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.03,0:22:51.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是 快点快点 我们还有安排\N{\fs50}But chop, chop. We're on a schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:52.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.13,0:23:13.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并不是“满是感染者” 对不对？\N{\fs50}Not exactly "full of Infected," is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.51,0:23:15.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 你说得对\N{\fs50}Okay, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:17.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们能不能 呃 停下来逛逛这些店？\N{\fs50}Can we, like, stop and check some of it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:20.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行 时间就是生命\N{\fs50}Nope. Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:25.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么有些店是空的 有些不是？\N{\fs50}Why are some of these stores empty and some not?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:27.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我妈之前说 感染爆发的时候\N{\fs50}My mom said when the outbreak happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.69,0:23:30.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,人们开始抢劫商店 直到军队关闭商场\N{\fs50}people started looting until the military shut it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.49,0:23:33.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那些被抢走的东西\N{\fs50}so the stuff that's gone is the stuff that people
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:36.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,估计是人们最需要或是最想要的吧 我猜\N{\fs50}needed the most, or wanted, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:41.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说得对 所以 是运动鞋\N{\fs50}Right. So, sneakers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.16,0:23:42.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而不是肥皂\N{\fs50}and not soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:44.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也不是那玩意儿\N{\fs50}Or that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:50.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不明白过去的人什么会想要那破烂玩意儿\N{\fs50}I don't get why people back then wanted all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你需要我解释给你听吗？\N{\fs50}Do you need me to explain it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.41,0:23:54.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呵呵 别了 我知道原因\N{\fs50}Haha. No. I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:57.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 只是 这看起来很不舒服 - 确实\N{\fs50}- It just looks uncomfortable. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:00.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.81,0:24:03.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事 我刚刚就想了想 你穿上身的样子\N{\fs50}Nothing. I was just trying to imagine you wearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:04.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fs50}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:09.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 跟上我\N{\fs50}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.15,0:24:10.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们快到了\N{\fs50}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:24.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉！ - 我来了！\N{\fs50}- Ellie! - I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.18,0:24:38.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在这里停一下\N{\fs50}Stop right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:40.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把眼睛闭上\N{\fs50}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.43,0:24:41.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 要干嘛？ - 闭上\N{\fs50}- What for? - Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.69,0:24:46.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你相信我吗？ - 命都交给你了 明摆着\N{\fs50}- Do you trust me? - With my life, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:48.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就好 把手给我\N{\fs50}Well then, give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:52.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.33,0:25:04.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快到了\N{\fs50}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.83,0:25:06.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到了吗？\N{\fs50}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:10.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快了 我说的是快了\N{\fs50}Almost. I said almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:12.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,睁开眼\N{\fs50}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:25.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.11,0:25:38.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.28,0:25:39.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 就是的\N{\fs50}- No way. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.07,0:26:17.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你看着我干吗？ - 没事\N{\fs50}- What? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.03,0:26:19.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你醉了 - 没有\N{\fs50}- You're drunk. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.11,0:26:20.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 有 - 还没醉呢\N{\fs50}- Yes. - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:21.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fs50}Gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.04,0:26:34.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 要我帮忙吗？ - 不用\N{\fs50}- Ya need help? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.80,0:26:43.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,劲啊\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:27.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行不行啊 妈的\N{\fs50}Come on. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.43,0:27:29.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我去看下能不能修好\N{\fs50}Let me see if I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.10,0:27:32.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fs50}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:37.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你当初离开 真的是因为你觉得你可以解放这里吗？\N{\fs50}Did you really leave because you actually think you could liberate this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.86,0:27:40.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别说得好像是痴人说梦一样 艾莉\N{\fs50}Don't say it like it's some type of fantasy, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:43.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在别的隔离区做到过\N{\fs50}They've done it in the other QZs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.16,0:27:45.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让一切重回正轨 像以前一样\N{\fs50}Set things right, the way they used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.95,0:27:47.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对呀 我们也可以\N{\fs50}Yeah, we could do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你回来的话\N{\fs50}If you come back, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.37,0:27:52.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不就是未来\N{\fs50}We're, like, the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.75,0:27:55.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你懂的 我们可以让未来更好\N{\fs50}You know, we could make things better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:57.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以管事儿\N{\fs50}We could be running things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.42,0:28:01.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可以管事儿\N{\fs50}You could be running things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.38,0:28:04.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我下个月就17岁了\N{\fs50}I turn 17 next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.34,0:28:06.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,到时候就得干活了\N{\fs50}That's when you get your assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:08.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道老邝给我派了什么活吗？\N{\fs50}You know what Kwong gave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.23,0:28:13.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下水道特别任务\N{\fs50}Sewage detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.98,0:28:15.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:18.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给铲屎的站岗\N{\fs50}Standing guard while people shovel shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:20.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在他们眼里就干这个的\N{\fs50}That's what they think of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.45,0:28:25.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些你为什么不告诉我？\N{\fs50}Why didn't you tell me any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.53,0:28:28.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fs50}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:31.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我——我慌了\N{\fs50}I just-- I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:36.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我逃掉了 而我离开得越久\N{\fs50}And I ran, and the longer I was away,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.25,0:28:39.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,回来也就越困难\N{\fs50}the harder it was for me to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:42.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么说明白吗？\N{\fs50}Is that making sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.30,0:28:44.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我懂\N{\fs50}No, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:49.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 你当时和我说 我也能懂\N{\fs50}I would've gotten it back then, too, ya know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.10,0:28:55.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 这狗屁地方我想念的只有你\N{\fs50}You know, you're the one thing I missed from that fucking place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不知道这么说你有没有好受点\N{\fs50}if that makes a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.61,0:29:02.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有吗？\N{\fs50}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.00,0:29:13.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fs50}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.25,0:29:16.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,两大奇迹看完了 还剩三个\N{\fs50}We're two wonders down, three more to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.21,0:29:17.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你还想继续的话\N{\fs50}if you wanna keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.83,0:29:21.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我都百万盏灯下骑魔法马儿了\N{\fs50}I mean, I'm on a magic horse with, like, a million lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.80,0:29:23.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道还有啥能比这更好的\N{\fs50}I don't know how it's supposed to get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.97,0:29:31.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是时间机器吗？\N{\fs50}Is that a time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:33.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.90,0:29:45.15,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,能不能和我一样酷？\N{\fs50}{\i1}Can you be cool like me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.15,0:29:46.78,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,摆出最酷的姿势\N{\fs50}{\i1}Strike your best pose.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.78,0:29:49.12,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,嘿 耍酷可不免费\N{\fs50}{\i1}Hey, being cool ain't free.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.12,0:29:50.72,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,请投入五美元\N{\fs50}{\i1}Please insert five dollars.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:51.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.62,0:29:54.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧 我有备而来\N{\fs50}Well, look at that. I came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.33,0:29:55.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你之前试过吗？\N{\fs50}Have you done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.79,0:29:58.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 傻子 我等着和你一起呢\N{\fs50}No, idiot. I was waiting to do it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:05.90,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,记住 摆出你最酷的姿势\N{\fs50}{\i1}Remember, strike your coolest pose.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.90,0:30:06.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧 小兔子\N{\fs50}Let's go, bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.55,0:30:11.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.64,0:30:12.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们摆什么好？\N{\fs50}What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:14.39,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,看着真不错\N{\fs50}{\i1}Lookin' great.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 兔子耳朵？\N{\fs50}Okay, bunny ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.02,0:30:17.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fs50}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:18.40,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,说“起司”\N{\fs50}{\i1}Say "cheese."{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:19.65,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,换个姿势\N{\fs50}{\i1}Find another pose.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.77,0:30:22.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 背靠背？ - 好\N{\fs50}- Back-to-back? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:25.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 吓人脸 吓人脸 - 好\N{\fs50}- Do scary, do scary. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:28.49,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fs50}{\i1}Time's up.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:29.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\c&H70D7F9}- 谢谢你的酷姿势 {\c&HE5E5E9}- 好了 好了\N{\fs50}{\c&H70D7F9}{\i1}- Thanks for all your cool poses.{\i} {\c&HE5E5E9}- Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.74,0:30:31.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 好 好 抱歉\N{\fs50}- Get off of me. - Okay, okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.53,0:30:32.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的错\N{\fs50}I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:33.99,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你的照片马上就好\N{\fs50}{\i1}Your photos are almost done.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.99,0:30:35.83,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,来看看你的大作\N{\fs50}{\i1}Let's see how ya did.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.67,0:30:40.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 噢 来了 {\c&H70D7F9}- 谢谢光临\N{\fs50}{\c&HE5E5E9}- Oh, yeah. {\c&H70D7F9}-{\i1}Thanks for hoppin' on by.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.79,0:30:42.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来瞧瞧\N{\fs50}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:44.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 操\N{\fs50}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.13,0:30:48.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这张还不错\N{\fs50}That one's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:51.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要喜欢 那就是你的了\N{\fs50}If you like it, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.90,0:31:05.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧 咱还有地方要去 还有奇迹要瞧\N{\fs50}Come on. We got places to be and wonders to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.69,0:31:08.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们要去第几大奇迹来着\N{\fs50}Are we going to whatever number we're up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:11.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,商场第四大奇迹 希望你准备好了\N{\fs50}Fourth wonder of the mall, and I hope you're prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.49,0:31:13.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为它超级超级棒\N{\fs50}because it's pretty dang awesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.49,0:31:14.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可能招架不住\N{\fs50}and it might break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:16.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别把话说满了 老兄\N{\fs50}Don't oversell, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.46,0:31:21.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,仔细听\N{\fs50}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.47,0:31:33.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉？\N{\fs50}Riley?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:35.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.39,0:31:38.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子见过最美的景象了\N{\fs50}This is the most beautiful thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.81,0:31:42.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 是吧 - 是\N{\fs50}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.42,0:32:04.00,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,紧急通知\N{\fs50}{\i1}This is an emergency broadcast.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:09.01,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,地球已被火星飞碟入侵！\N{\fs50}{\i1}The Earth is being invaded by flying saucers from Mars!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:11.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 好啊\N{\fs50}Ohh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.01,0:32:12.55,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,选一匹赛马\N{\fs50}{\i1}Select a racehorse.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:14.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,酷啊\N{\fs50}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.06,0:32:27.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你有钱吗？\N{\fs50}Do you have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:31.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不是这些垃圾 要硬币\N{\fs50}No, not that useless shit. Coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:33.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一次都玩不了\N{\fs50}We can't even play once.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:43.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你个狗逼 - 我个狗逼\N{\fs50}- You asshole. - Yeah, I'm the same asshole
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:47.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,昨天花了一小时才把这玩意砸开\N{\fs50}that spent an hour yesterday breaking this fucker open.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.38,0:32:50.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs50}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.51,0:32:59.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fs50}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:02.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 老兄 - 是吧\N{\fs50}- Dude. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.77,0:33:07.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 你准备好了吗？\N{\fs50}- Oh, my God. - Ya ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.15,0:33:08.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.20,0:33:21.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fs50}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:26.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,雷电 真他妈赞！\N{\fs50}Raiden. Fuck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.62,0:33:27.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\c&H70D7F9}- 美莲娜 {\c&HE5E5E9}- 美莲娜\N{\fs50}{\c&H70D7F9}-{\i1}Mileena.{\i} {\c&HE5E5E9}- Mileena.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.13,0:33:30.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死亡之池\N{\fs50}Dead Pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.38,0:33:31.86,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,第一回合 开始\N{\fs50}{\i1}Round one. Fight.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.86,0:33:32.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 要怎么玩？\N{\fs50}Wait, how do I play?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.67,0:33:34.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 乱按就行 - 按钮也太多了\N{\fs50}- Smash the buttons. - There's so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.43,0:33:40.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啪\N{\fs50}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:41.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 得用摇杆 - 好\N{\fs50}- Use the joystick more. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.48,0:33:47.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,美莲娜胜利\N{\fs50}Mileena wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.90,0:33:49.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这游戏扯淡吧\N{\fs50}That is such horseshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.48,0:33:51.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这叫无懈可击 准备好了吗？\N{\fs50}Flawless horseshit. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.94,0:33:54.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\c&H70D7F9}- 第二回合 开始 {\c&HE5E5E9}- 等等！我还没——妈的\N{\fs50}{\c&H70D7F9}-{\i1}Round two. Fight.{\i} {\c&HE5E5E9}- No! I'm-- Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 用摇杆\N{\fs50}Okay. Joystick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:01.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你好会玩啊！ - 我怎么按出来的？\N{\fs50}- You're doin' so good! - How am I doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.20,0:34:02.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,了结他\N{\fs50}{\i1}Finish him.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:04.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 了结他！ - 不要了结我\N{\fs50}- Finish him! - Do not finish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.20,0:34:07.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你就看不到这个了\N{\fs50}But then you wouldn't get to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.92,0:34:13.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我操！ {\c&H70D7F9}- 美莲娜胜利\N{\fs50}{\c&HE5E5E9}- Fuck! {\c&H70D7F9}-{\i1}Mileena wins.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.38,0:34:15.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\c&H70D7F9}- 致命一击 {\c&HE5E5E9}- 致命一击\N{\fs50}{\c&H70D7F9}-{\i1}Fatality.{\i} {\c&HE5E5E9}- Fatality{\i1}.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.26,0:34:16.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 确实挺酷的\N{\fs50}Okay, that was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.76,0:34:18.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道\N{\fs50}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.09,0:34:19.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你玩过几次？\N{\fs50}How many times have you played this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.89,0:34:23.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我来过这儿几次\N{\fs50}I mean, I've been here a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.39,0:34:26.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看来 你也不是什么都等着我一起做嘛\N{\fs50}So you don't wait to do everything with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.48,0:34:31.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再来？\N{\fs50}Go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.44,0:34:33.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fs50}Goddamn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.03,0:34:41.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？ - 第一回合 开始\N{\fs50}- Ready? - Round one. Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.07,0:34:43.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 别高兴早了 - 我操\N{\fs50}- Not for long. - Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:47.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你作弊！ - 我没作弊 只是你要输而已\N{\fs50}- You're cheating! - I'm not cheating. You're just losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.00,0:34:48.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行 就冲你刚才那下 啪！\N{\fs50}Okay. Just for that. Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.96,0:34:50.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啪！\N{\fs50}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:52.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fs50}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.41,0:35:25.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这下很漂亮 我得承认\N{\fs50}That was a good punch. I can't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.95,0:35:29.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 好！中招了吧 - 你打得我落花流水啊\N{\fs50}- Yeah! Gotcha. - You are beating my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.79,0:35:31.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天！\N{\fs50}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.17,0:35:33.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么办？我该怎么办？ - 好 后 前\N{\fs50}- Now, what do I do? What do I do? - Okay, back, forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.13,0:35:34.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下 前 下拳！\N{\fs50}down, forward, low punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:45.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:46.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下一站\N{\fs50}Next thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.69,0:35:56.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fs50}It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.98,0:36:00.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还得起床 整理被褥了\N{\fs50}I have to wake up and make my bed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.65,0:36:01.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fs50}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:04.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们还有几小时\N{\fs50}We still have a few hours left, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.91,0:36:07.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 但我不能再惹麻烦了\N{\fs50}Yeah, I just can't get in trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:11.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但 我可以明天再来这见你\N{\fs50}But I'll meet you here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.21,0:36:17.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我准备了礼物\N{\fs50}I got you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.21,0:36:22.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我确实挺喜欢礼物\N{\fs50}I mean, I do like gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.43,0:36:24.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 是蜘蛛吗？ - 不是\N{\fs50}- Is it a spider? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.59,0:36:26.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 是新衣服吗？ - 不是\N{\fs50}- Is it a new shirt? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.01,0:36:27.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是水枪吗？\N{\fs50}Is it a water pistol?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.39,0:36:28.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 更好 - 更好？\N{\fs50}- Better. - Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.89,0:36:30.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 是恐龙吗？ - 有可能\N{\fs50}- Is it a dinosaur? - Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.77,0:36:32.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 如果是恐龙 我就当回你最好的朋友\N{\fs50}I mean, I'll be your best friend again if it's a dinosaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.77,0:36:34.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说真的 当回我最好的朋友？\N{\fs50}Really, my best friend again?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.27,0:36:36.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 你已经是我最好的朋友了\N{\fs50}Ellie, you are already my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.90,0:36:38.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fs50}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:40.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是塔可饼？\N{\fs50}Is it tacos?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:45.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 不是塔可饼\N{\fs50}Okay, not tacos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.83,0:36:58.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这就是你住的地儿？\N{\fs50}Is this where you've been staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.21,0:36:59.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大部分时候吧\N{\fs50}Mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.76,0:37:04.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“第‘二’册”\N{\fs50}"Volume Too."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.59,0:37:07.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,扯吧！还有第二册？\N{\fs50}Shut up! They made a second one?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.14,0:37:09.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿弄来的？\N{\fs50}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.89,0:37:14.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“沮丧的食人族会怎样？”\N{\fs50}"What did the frustrated cannibal do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.56,0:37:17.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 说答案吧 - “他吐出了他的手”\N{\fs50}- Lay it on me. -"He threw up his hands."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.42,0:37:20.42,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,throw up one's hands：（美语）放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:21.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 给我 我想来 好了 - 好\N{\fs50}- Gimme. I wanna go. Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.74,0:37:28.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“三角形对圆形说了啥？”\N{\fs50}"What did the triangle say to the circle?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.66,0:37:31.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“你这个没用的东西”\N{\fs50}"You're so pointless."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.60,0:37:34.80,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,point：尖角；pointless：没有尖角
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:34.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.75,0:37:37.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 “电脑要怎样才会喝醉？”\N{\fs50}Okay, "How does a computer get drunk?"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:39.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“截屏就行了”\N{\fs50}"It takes screenshots."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:42.70,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs48}screenshot：截屏\Nshot：一口酒、一杯酒；screenshots即“一屏幕的酒”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.09,0:37:43.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 截屏是啥？ - 我也不知道\N{\fs50}- What are screenshots? - I don't actually know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:44.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 给我\N{\fs50}Okay, gimme.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.51,0:37:48.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fs50}Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:58.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听这个 “鳄鱼穿上马甲就成了什么？”\N{\fs50}Here we go. "What do you call an alligator in a vest?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.53,0:38:07.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些是你做的吗？\N{\fs50}Did you make these?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.12,0:38:11.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 艾莉 把它放下\N{\fs50}Yes, Ellie, put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:14.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用来杀士兵的？\N{\fs50}To kill soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.46,0:38:20.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这间商场不是你找到的 对吧？\N{\fs50}You didn't find this mall, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.25,0:38:21.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们派你守在这儿\N{\fs50}They posted you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.92,0:38:23.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,派新兵来守仓库？\N{\fs50}A new recruit guarding their stash?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.55,0:38:27.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们绝不会把这些用在你身上 或者你附近的地方\N{\fs50}We would never use them on you or anywhere ever near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:29.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我绝不会让他们这么做\N{\fs50}I would never let them do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.93,0:38:31.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不会让他们这么做？\N{\fs50}You would never let them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.72,0:38:33.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哈 你觉得他们会听你的？\N{\fs50}Right, and you think they're gonna listen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.23,0:38:42.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fs50}I mean, I guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.57,0:38:43.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉 - 没事 我要走了\N{\fs50}- Ellie. - It's okay. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:44.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.69,0:38:46.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.57,0:38:49.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.74,0:38:51.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些他妈的根本不是为了我！\N{\fs50}None of this shit was even about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.28,0:38:52.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你能停下吗？ - 去你妈的！\N{\fs50}- Would you stop? - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.99,0:38:53.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.99,0:38:56.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 我要走了\N{\fs50}Ellie, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:04.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们要派我去亚特兰大隔离区\N{\fs50}They're sending me to a post in the Atlanta QZ.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.59,0:39:11.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我问能不能让你加入 这样我们就能一起走了\N{\fs50}I asked if you could join so we could go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:15.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但玛琳不同意\N{\fs50}But Marlene said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.29,0:39:16.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳是他妈谁？\N{\fs50}Who the fuck is Marlene?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.02,0:39:17.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳就是那个介绍我入伙的女士——\N{\fs50}Marlene is the lady that helped me get--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:19.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些不重要\N{\fs50}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.65,0:39:23.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉 我争取过了\N{\fs50}Ellie, I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:28.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今夜是我在波士顿的最后一晚\N{\fs50}Tonight's my last night in Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:50.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么带我来这里？\N{\fs50}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.97,0:39:54.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为我想见你\N{\fs50}Because I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.43,0:39:58.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fs50}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.56,0:40:01.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fs50}And
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.57,0:40:12.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我想和你告别\N{\fs50}and I wanted to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.29,0:40:20.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 这么做不容易 艾莉 - 挺容易的\N{\fs50}- This isn't easy, Ellie. - It actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.87,0:40:23.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你刚就这么做了\N{\fs50}You just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.58,0:40:26.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fs50}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.68,0:41:22.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.10,0:41:23.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉？\N{\fs50}Riley?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:28.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉！\N{\fs50}Riley!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.86,0:41:34.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fs50}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.62,0:41:40.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,惊喜吧\N{\fs50}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.25,0:41:45.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,第五大奇迹\N{\fs50}The fifth wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.54,0:41:51.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得这个你会最喜欢 所以我留到了最后\N{\fs50}I thought you'd like this one the best, so I saved it for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.59,0:41:54.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可能挺蠢的吧\N{\fs50}I guess that was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.97,0:41:56.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我他妈挺蠢的\N{\fs50}I'm fucking stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.36,0:41:57.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把书给我\N{\fs50}Gimme the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:25.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你离开了我\N{\fs50}So you leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fs50}I think you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:30.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,突然一下子 你又活了过来\N{\fs50}All of a sudden, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.92,0:42:33.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后你给了我这一夜\N{\fs50}And you give me this night,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.42,0:42:36.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这他妈美好的一夜\N{\fs50}this amazing fucking night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:39.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在你又要离开\N{\fs50}And now you're leaving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.59,0:42:40.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,永远离开\N{\fs50}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.80,0:42:45.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,离开去搞些你都闹不明白的事业\N{\fs50}To join some cause I don't even think you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.43,0:42:47.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来说服我\N{\fs50}Tell me I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.73,0:42:54.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得你不是什么都懂\N{\fs50}I think that you don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:02.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不知道有家的感觉\N{\fs50}You don't know what it was like to have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.32,0:43:03.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,归属感\N{\fs50}To belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.87,0:43:08.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我拥有的时间不长 但我拥有过\N{\fs50}I didn't have them for long, but I had them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.00,0:43:10.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我属于他们\N{\fs50}I belonged to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.71,0:43:13.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还想要那种感觉\N{\fs50}And I want that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.75,0:43:17.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许火荧和我想的不一样\N{\fs50}Maybe the Fireflies aren't what I think they are
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.63,0:43:19.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但他们选择了我\N{\fs50}but they chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.97,0:43:23.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在乎我\N{\fs50}I matter to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.14,0:43:27.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我先在乎你的\N{\fs50}You mattered to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.39,0:43:31.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的 我真想揍你\N{\fs50}Goddamn it, I wanna punch you so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.36,0:43:35.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果这能让你少恨我一点的话\N{\fs50}If it makes you hate me less.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.95,0:43:41.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fs50}And you're sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.66,0:43:43.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的要走？\N{\fs50}About leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.41,0:43:51.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.51,0:44:00.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.05,0:44:06.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这么说也没带什么脾气\N{\fs50}And I'm not saying it all pissy and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.64,0:44:12.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是我最好的朋友\N{\fs50}You're my best friend
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.36,0:44:16.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我会想念你的\N{\fs50}and I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.82,0:44:23.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.66,0:44:26.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今夜还没结束呢\N{\fs50}night's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.95,0:44:30.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,最后一站？\N{\fs50}One last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.62,0:44:32.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fs50}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.59,0:44:45.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.02,0:44:53.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你给我这东西干啥？\N{\fs50}What am I supposed to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.19,0:44:54.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,戴上啊 笨蛋\N{\fs50}Put it on, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.67,0:44:55.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fs50}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.85,0:44:57.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为很好玩\N{\fs50}'Cause it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.48,0:45:00.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且这里音乐也太烂了\N{\fs50}And this music sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.82,0:45:04.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你个小偷！ - 我本来肯定\N{\fs50}- You little thief! - I was definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.78,0:45:07.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许会还给你的\N{\fs50}probably gonna give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.78,0:45:08.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fs50}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.35,0:45:29.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,认真的？\N{\fs50}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.51,0:45:32.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我不——\N{\fs50}- Come on. - I don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.14,0:45:34.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快他妈上来\N{\fs50}Get your ass up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.86,0:45:47.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fs50}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:07.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有我在 宝贝\N{\fs50}{\i1}I got you, babe{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.91,0:46:37.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.92,0:46:41.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fs50}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.17,0:46:48.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.02,0:47:04.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fs50}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.83,0:47:20.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,下面做什么？\N{\fs50}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:24.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fs50}We're gonna figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.80,0:47:33.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备逃跑\N{\fs50}Get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:40.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走！走！走！\N{\fs50}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.47,0:48:13.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,离我他妈远点！\N{\fs50}Get the fuck off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:46.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操！\N{\fs50}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.64,0:49:04.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.15,0:49:12.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不不不不不！\N{\fs50}No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.15,0:49:13.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.41,0:50:05.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托 拜托 拜托\N{\fs50}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:15.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你妈的！操！操！\N{\fs50}You motherfucker! Fuck you! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:17.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈——操！\N{\fs50}You mother-- Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.35,0:50:26.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边还有东西可以砸\N{\fs50}There's more stuff over there you can break.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.28,0:50:36.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fs50}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:40.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我看来 我们有两个选项\N{\fs50}Way I see it, we got two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.16,0:50:43.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,选项一\N{\fs50}One,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.04,0:50:45.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们早早了断\N{\fs50}we take the easy way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.25,0:50:49.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么着很快 也不算疼\N{\fs50}It's quick, painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.46,0:50:55.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不 我不喜欢选项一\N{\fs50}No, no, I don't like option one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.63,0:51:00.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,选项二\N{\fs50}Option two,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.80,0:51:03.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们坚持下去\N{\fs50}we just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.14,0:51:10.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莱莉 你在说什么？已经结束了\N{\fs50}What are you talking about, Riley? It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.69,0:51:14.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会结束的 但现在还没有\N{\fs50}It will be, but not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.90,0:51:18.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所有人都会有这一天 不是吗？\N{\fs50}It ends this way for everyone sooner or later, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.53,0:51:23.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有些人只是来得更快而已\N{\fs50}Some of us just get there faster than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.45,0:51:27.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们不放弃\N{\fs50}But we don't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.25,0:51:32.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不论\N{\fs50}Whether
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.75,0:51:35.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是两分钟\N{\fs50}it's two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:38.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是两天\N{\fs50}or two days
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.05,0:51:42.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不放弃\N{\fs50}we don't give that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.22,0:51:46.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不想放弃\N{\fs50}I don't wanna give that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.48,0:51:54.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,诗意也好 糟糕也罢 让我们一起失去意志吧\N{\fs50}We can just be all poetic and shit and lose our minds together.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.86,0:52:00.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,选项三呢？\N{\fs50}What's option three?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.24,0:52:07.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fs50}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.44,0:53:58.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fs50}Okay, okay.
